;; Seed Genome manifest — EvoCLJ v1 (Task 6.6, Milestone 6 exit fixture).
;;
;; The v1 manifest is a CLOSED map validated by evoclj.genome.schema at
;; the trust boundary: the four declared modules below are the only
;; files the loader may trust, the ABI pins the kernel/genome/intent/
;; tool interface versions, and the evolution policy bounds the risk
;; class a later milestone may mutate at (:behavioral is the ceiling
;; for the seed generation).
;;
;; :capabilities/requested is a DECLARATION ONLY (Global Constraint 9):
;; whether :model/call or :tool/call is actually granted is decided
;; later by the kernel-owned capability broker against the host-issued
;; leases, never by this file. The seed's executable flow grants a
;; :fixture/echo lease; its :tool node's :fixture/non-idempotent
;; request is scope-denied (visible-but-ungranted tools never grant
;; resource authority).
{:genome/format 1
 :agent/id :seed
 :agent/entry :graph/seed
 :abi {:kernel 1 :genome 1 :intent 1 :tool 1}
 :modules {:topology "topology.edn"
           :models "models.edn"
           :memory "memory.edn"
           :evolution "evolution.edn"}
 :capabilities/requested #{:model/call :tool/call}
 :evolution {:max-risk :behavioral
             :mutable #{:parameters :prompts :skills :programs}}
 :metadata {:name "evoclj-seed"
            :description "EvoCLJ seed Genome — deterministic end-to-end fixture task (Milestone 6)"}}
